sequenceDiagram
    participant UI as Settings Screen
    participant B as Connections Service

    UI->>UI: user clicks "Remove" / "Disconnect" → confirm popover
    UI->>UI: user confirms
    UI->>B: DELETE /api/connections/{id}
    B->>B: clear token; status → disconnected
    B-->>UI: 200 { status: "disconnected" }
    UI->>UI: refresh connection card (back to not-configured state)

    alt unknown conn_id
        B-->>UI: 404 Not found
    end